      "content": "i guess. it just feels like if life has no inherent meaning or value, then staying here is just a choice i'm making out of habit. if i look at it logically, there's no reason to choose existence over non-existence. it's basically a neutral outcome, right? like, if nothing matters, then dying isn't \"bad,\" it's just another option.",
